# Local: http://localhost:5000 | Docker: http://localhost:6000
@Gateway_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Gateway Health Check / Info
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Identity Service via Gateway - Đăng ký tài khoản (Public - Không cần Token)
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "rider01@swiftride.com",
  "userName": "rider01",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "fullName": "Nguyen Van A",
  "role": "Rider"
}

###

### 2.1. Identity Service via Gateway - Đăng ký tài khoản Driver
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "driver01@swiftride.com",
  "userName": "driver01",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "fullName": "Tran Van Driver",
  "role": "Driver"
}

###

### 3. Identity Service via Gateway - Đăng nhập lấy JWT Token (Public - Không cần Token)
# @name login
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "rider01@swiftride.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

### Lưu token từ response login vào biến (nếu dùng REST Client mở rộng)
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 4. Matching Service via Gateway - Chưa có Token (Kỳ vọng Gateway chặn 401 Unauthorized)
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/matching/match
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "riderId": "c0a80123-4567-89ab-cdef-0123456789ab",
  "pickupLocation": {
    "latitude": 10.762622,
    "longitude": 106.660172
  },
  "dropoffLocation": {
    "latitude": 10.776889,
    "longitude": 106.700806
  }
}

###

### 5. Matching Service via Gateway - Có JWT Token (Gateway xác thực hợp lệ & forward sang Matching.API)
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/matching/match
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "riderId": "c0a80123-4567-89ab-cdef-0123456789ab",
  "pickupLocation": {
    "latitude": 10.762622,
    "longitude": 106.660172
  },
  "dropoffLocation": {
    "latitude": 10.776889,
    "longitude": 106.700806
  }
}

###

### 6. Payment Service via Gateway - Chưa có Token (Kỳ vọng Gateway chặn 401 Unauthorized)
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tripId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "riderId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "amount": 50000,
  "method": 1
}

###

### 7. Payment Service via Gateway - Có JWT Token (Gateway xác thực hợp lệ & forward sang Payment.API)
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "tripId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "riderId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "amount": 50000,
  "method": 1
}

###

### 8. Payment Service via Gateway - Lấy danh sách ví (GET /api/v1/payments/wallets)
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/payments/wallets
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

